// Ends a command: the paragraphs it made stale are laid out again and the pages made again, the part of the picture that changed is asked for (the paragraphs it touched and what moved, and the paragraphs of the selection as it is now), the caret is brought into view, and it is solid again for a blink.
cv_end(View cvv) {
  int[] cvl_r = cv_stale(cvv);
  int cvi_np = lay_page_count(cvv);
  int cvi_n = cv_lay(cvv, cvl_r);
